# Esmia HB

> Spanish delicatessen and live paella catering in Stockholm. Esmia HB has imported and sold Spanish products since {{ metadata.foundingYear }}. We supply restaurants and cater private parties, weddings and corporate events.

## What we do

- Live paella catering, cooked in front of your guests, anywhere in Stockholm.
- Spanish delicatessen at wholesale and retail: cured ham, chorizo, cheese, pantry goods and tapas.
- Restaurant supply. We have delivered Spanish products to Swedish restaurants since {{ metadata.foundingYear }}.

